      "side": 1,
      "message": "This `else` branch now seems problematic because `cpi-\u003ethis_frame_target` may become smaller than `min_frame_target`. I wonder if we should move the if statement at lines 617-619 here.\n\nBut note that we check `cpi-\u003ethis_frame_target \u003e min_frame_target` at line 628. So it\u0027s not clear whether we need to prevent `cpi-\u003ethis_frame_target` from becoming smaller than `min_frame_target` here.",
